<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/tNryhx8sZkX1HFkBZmOCdkCte9F2/reliable-transit">Reliable transit</a>: For many Chicagoans, the CTA isn’t working. Too many Chicagoans are forced to pay $20 for an Uber because they can’t trust a bus or train after dark. That is the Safety Tax, and working families pay it every night. On…</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/tNryhx8sZkX1HFkBZmOCdkCte9F2/no-new-taxes">No New Taxes</a>: Property taxes in Chicago have risen sharply and residents are rightly frustrated and angry. No new taxes. Chicago families are already paying more and getting less. John Kelly will hold the line on any new taxes that…</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/tNryhx8sZkX1HFkBZmOCdkCte9F2/kids-who-can-read">Kids Who Can Read</a>: Every child in Chicago deserves a school where they can learn to read, do math, build confidence, and prepare for a real future. That is the basic promise public education makes to every family. Right now Chicago is not…</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/tNryhx8sZkX1HFkBZmOCdkCte9F2/a-modern-city-charter-and-accountable-government">A Modern City Charter and Accountable Government</a>: Chicago’s outgoing Inspector General concluded that the city “operates at a deficit of legitimacy.”. Four of the top candidates for mayor are career politicians who have run for 14 different offices in the last decade…</li>
